        },
        {
          "text": "The Three Notes That Drop",
          "link": {
            "kind": "article",
            "slug": "minor-caged-the-three-that-drop"
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " taught you change when A major becomes A minor. Everything else in the set holds still."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Two down, five to go. And the obvious next worry is the one you're probably already having: five more scales to learn on the neck."
        }
      ]
    }
